{comment: Chorus 1}
[G]I exalt Thee, I e[D]xalt Thee, I e[C]xalt Thee, O [G]Lord.
[G]I exalt Thee, I e[D]xalt Thee, I e[C]xalt Thee, O [G]Lord.

{comment: Chorus 2}
[G]I lift my hands to [D]You, I lift my hands to [C]You, I lift my hands to [G]You, O Lord.
